{"provider": "google-cloud-vision:document_text_detection", "full_text": "I further certify and attest that I have affixed hereto recent photographs of the\nexecutants to the protocol of the deed and that stamp duty to the value a sum of\nRupees One Hundred and Ninety One Thousand Seven Hundred and Eighty\n(Rs.191,780/=) was duly deposited in cash in the Bank of Ceylon Battaramulla branch\nin proof of which the original of such stamp duty paying in slip No. BC/SE/OP\nNo.296912 dated 18/07/2025 for Rs.191,780/= is affixed to the duplicate of this\ninstrument and, copies are affixed to the original and the protocol and the Original of\nthis instrument bears one stamp of Re.1/= and that the said stamp was supplied by\nme.\nAnd I have applied for the renewal of the license for the current year.\nDate of Attestation\n18th July 2025.\nCS CamScanner\nWHICH I\nATTEST\nNotary Public.\n}\n!\nW.W.ANURA DHAN\nB\nSri Lanka\nAttorney-at-Law\n&\nNotary Public\nCOLOMBO\n*\n13", "detected_languages": [{"code": "en", "confidence": 0.9637}], "words": [{"text": "I", "confidence": 0.9391, "polygon": [[0.210774, 0.842105], [0.210774, 0.832426], [0.225737, 0.832426], [0.225737, 0.842105]]}, {"text": "further", "confidence": 0.9919, "polygon": [[0.210346, 0.825771], [0.210774, 0.766485], [0.226165, 0.766485], [0.225737, 0.825771]]}, {"text": "certify", "confidence": 0.9923, "polygon": [[0.210774, 0.758621], [0.211201, 0.703569], [0.226593, 0.703569], [0.226165, 0.758621]]}, {"text": "and", "confidence": 0.9893, "polygon": [[0.211201, 0.6951], [0.211201, 0.664247], [0.226165, 0.664247], [0.226165, 0.6951]]}, {"text": "attest", "confidence": 0.9917, "polygon": [[0.211629, 0.653962], [0.212056, 0.607985], [0.22702, 0.607985], [0.226593, 0.653962]]}, {"text": "that", "confidence": 0.9935, "polygon": [[0.211629, 0.598911], [0.211629, 0.566243], [0.22702, 0.566243], [0.22702, 0.598911]]}, {"text": "I", "confidence": 0.9886, "polygon": [[0.212056, 0.556564], [0.212056, 0.549304], [0.22702, 0.5493